OL,3,AJury out in train stabbing attempted   
OL,4,Amurder trial                           
OL,6,FAfter summing up the evidence in the   
OL,7,Fcase at Cambridge Crown Court, the     
OL,8,Fjudge, Mr Justice Calver KC, sent the  
OL,9,Fjury out to start its deliberations. It
OL,10,Fwill resume on Tuesday.                
